{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You inherited a debt you never asked for. Now, mining is your only way out.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After your grandfather passed away, <strong>the debt he left behind fell to you</strong>. Unable to pay, you were thrown into an abandoned debtor\u2019s mine \u2014 where the only path to freedom is to dig, survive, and earn. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore tunnels, find new paths, and search for valuable areas.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685510/extras/exploring-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746483501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Set up structures to survive longer and reach new areas.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685510/extras/Constraction-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746483501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use a grappling hook to move through difficult terrain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685510/extras/alpinist-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746483501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dig, break, and collect everything you can find.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685510/extras/digging-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746483501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather mined resources for trading and profit.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685510/extras/Collect-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746483501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>